 ```
 
+Names outside its zones are resolved by the host's resolver. `--dns-upstream ip:port` (repeatable)
+sends them to the given servers instead, and `--dns-upstream none` refuses them, so that the VM
+cannot resolve, or send data in, names of the outside world.
